<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Jones co-opts Eugene Greene as new chairman.</title>
<headline>Jones co-opts Eugene Greene as new chairman.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish engineering and shipping company Jones Group Plc said on Friday that it had co-opted Eugene Greene to its board as chairman designate.</p>
<p>Jones Group said in a statement that Greene will replace Denis Magee as chairman in advance of the group's annual meeting in May.</p>
<p>--Dublin newsroom 353-1-661-3377.</p>
</text>
